### Get catches with species rainbow trout
GET http://localhost:3000/catches?species=rainbow%20trout HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### Get catches with species rainbow trout
GET http://localhost:3000/search?search=Worm HTTP/1.1

### Get all catches
GET http://localhost:3000/catches HTTP/1.1


### Sort By Length Ascending
GET http://localhost:3000/catches?sort=length_in&order=ascending HTTP/1.1

### Sort By Length Descending
GET http://localhost:3000/catches?sort=length_in&order=descending HTTP/1.1

### Sort By Weight Ascending
GET http://localhost:3000/catches?sort=weight&order=ascending HTTP/1.1

### Sort By Weight Descending
GET http://localhost:3000/catches?sort=weight&order=descending HTTP/1.1


### Invalid Request: Bad date
POST http://localhost:3000/catches HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "date": "number",
    "species": "rainbow trout",
    "weight": 2,
    "length_in": 14,
    "bait": "Powerbait Pink Mice Tail",
    "story": "Epic battle dude",
    "coordinates": [37.4525, 118.7372] 
}

